<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A3.SS0.SSS0.Px8" title="In Appendix C Baseline Method Introduction ‣ MetaEmbed: Scaling Multimodal Retrieval at Test-Time with Flexible Late Interaction" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">mmE5 <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<span class="ltx_ref">Chen et al., 2025b</span>)</cite>.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A3.SS0.SSS0.Px9" title="In Appendix C Baseline Method Introduction ‣ MetaEmbed: Scaling Multimodal Retrieval at Test-Time with Flexible Late Interaction" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">MoCa <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<span class="ltx_ref">Chen et al., 2025a</span>)</cite>.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A3.SS0.SSS0.Px10" title="In Appendix C Baseline Method Introduction ‣ MetaEmbed: Scaling Multimodal Retrieval at Test-Time with Flexible Late Interaction" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">B3 <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<span class="ltx_ref">Thirukovalluru et al., 2025a</span>)</cite></span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></nav>
